sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as You
  participant AppA as Your phone
  participant S as Supabase
  participant AppB as Partner's phone
  A->>AppA: save a booking (offline)
  AppA->>AppA: SQLite row, status createdLocally
  AppA->>AppA: outbox item with a frozen copy of the row
  Note over AppA: the screen shows it at once
  Note over AppA: connection back
  AppA->>S: upsert (marked to ignore its own realtime echo for 4 s)
  S->>S: RLS, triggers: updated_at, sync_log, balances
  S-->>AppA: ok
  AppA->>AppA: row → synced, outbox item removed
  S-->>AppB: realtime: booking changed
  AppB->>S: sync_all with its cursors
  S-->>AppB: upserts + deletes since the cursor
  AppB->>AppB: apply, unless its own copy is still unsent
